	<name>Portland_Traction_track_for_correction.kml</name>
	<open>1</open>
	<description>Digital Model Railway track for hand correction. Delete a piece that is wrong, redraw a piece (keep its name), draw any missing track as a new path, drag station pins to the right spot, and note anything in a description. Red = placed by estimate.</description>
